# T-977: Named-field constructor calling convention (B-337 regression).
# inject_adt_constructors_expr generates [fn [...payload] [variant "Tag" payload]].
# Calling [Boxed value: 42] with named args fails E020 — variadic positional params
# don't collect named args. Fix tracked in B-337 (blocked on S-850).
[
  Box: [type [Boxed value: Int]]
  result: [Boxed value: 42]
]
=== error
[E020] arity mismatch: expected 1 argument, got 2 (defined at 1:1-1:1)
